# REQUIRES: python-api, hdf5, cuda
# Checkpoints of a Python simulation (D[python-checkpoints]) on the GPU in
# double precision, scenario python-to-python of Inputs/python_checkpoints.py.
# A Python simulation with tunables updated before its checkpoint, continued
# from the file: the state, the tunables with their version and history,
# and the energy rows of the run that did not stop; `mdir run` refuses to
# continue it and begins a stage from it.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_checkpoints.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide GPU Double mdir %t python-to-python | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: Python -> Python NVE with tunables GPU Double
# CHECK: checkpoints python-to-python GPU Double passed
